        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guilford%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1961, the original covered bridge was replaced by a concrete span, yet the historic structure was saved and moved to its current park location.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
