      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guilford%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Guilford sits where Tanners Creek splits, a geographic feature that helped shape its early layout.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
